<GuideLayout 
  title="How to Launch an Activewear Brand: A Step-by-Step Guide"
  type="BRAND BUILDING"
  description="From technical sketches to mass production. A complete roadmap for emerging entrepreneurs looking to scale with Fitclo."
>
  <p>Launching a brand is a marathon. Here is our recommended roadmap for success.</p>
  <h3>Phase 1: Market Research</h3>
  <p>Define your niche—yoga, gym, running, or lounge. Understand your target price point and audience.</p>
  <h3>Phase 2: Tech Pack Development</h3>
  <p>Create detailed sketches with measurements and fabric specs. This is the blueprint for your product.</p>
  <h3>Phase 3: Sampling</h3>
  <p>Work with Fitclo to produce prototypes. Test the fit, the fabric feel, and the performance under stress.</p>
  <h3>Phase 4: Mass Production</h3>
  <p>Once samples are approved, production begins. We handle everything from bulk fabric booking to final tagging.</p>
</GuideLayout>
